      "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>I used the print format builder to set the print format for a document.</p>\n<p>In the form “Perihal:” is a field set for “small text”. (This means “Title:” in english)</p>\n<p>When printing the document, the text in the tile does not come after the colon “:” but has a weird spacing. How do I make it such that it comes right after the colon? T my understanding this needs to be coded but I havse tried several code suggested by chatgpt to no avail.</p>\n<p>I already set it to align to the left.</p>\n<p>Uploaded the screenshot of my error. The way it want it to appear is  “Perihal: matching warna”</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/c/3c4a10f766e29dfe1076f28b75a50aa7844375f2.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/3c4a10f766e29dfe1076f28b75a50aa7844375f2\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/c/3c4a10f766e29dfe1076f28b75a50aa7844375f2_2_689x264.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"8BlkJMbDK1v9I1A9bkzwP80fVrY\" width=\"689\" height=\"264\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/c/3c4a10f766e29dfe1076f28b75a50aa7844375f2_2_689x264.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/c/3c4a10f766e29dfe1076f28b75a50aa7844375f2_2_1033x396.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/c/3c4a10f766e29dfe1076f28b75a50aa7844375f2.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1283×492 17.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
